### *Power-fail resume (Pi + bath)*

1. Bath keeps mid-test NVS; master keeps sampler-chain NVS (`mst_pf`).
2. On unclean Pi boot **within** recipe `powerFailure` minutes: Pi sends `#PF-RESUME-TEST*` (no login, no recipe re-upload).
3. Soft pause uses `#RESUME-TEST*` only.
4. Over buffer: Pi aborts report (pending approval); do not PF-RESUME.
5. If wall-clock remaining recipe time was exhausted during outage (within buffer): Pi saves completion report; best-effort `#STOP-TEST*`.
